{"id":"wb-5-220","name":"释迦寺","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"释迦寺","text":"释迦寺，俗称大寺，是明代蔚州城扩建后，城内最大的佛教寺院，现为全国重点文物保护单位，是蔚州古城景区的景点之一。释迦寺位于中华人民共和国河北省张家口市蔚县城南。\n释迦寺前身为元代便存在的庵，后于明代洪武年间扩建蔚州城时扩建。占地面积近5000平方米，现存前殿、中殿、后殿等建筑，其中以中殿时代最早、形制最高、体量最大。释迦寺原属青原系曹洞宗寺庙。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E9%87%8A%E8%BF%A6%E5%AF%BA","revisionId":92576894,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=92576894","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/e7d78aaf62d1b66b6786e904.jpg","title":"释迦寺-1.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E9%87%8A%E8%BF%A6%E5%AF%BA-1.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/d/db/%E9%87%8A%E8%BF%A6%E5%AF%BA-1.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Fymking","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"","width":320,"height":213}}